        timingType: "Belt (EA288evo architecture with Euro 6d-ISC-FCM updates. Toothed timing belt driving the camshafts and the high-pressure fuel pump. Strict 210,000 km replacement interval, but the tensioner should be monitored for squeaking).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Bosch EDC17 with 2000+ bar injection pressure and improved Bosch CP4.1 high-pressure fuel pump. Features Twin-Dosing SCR technology).", engineLifespan: "400,000+ km (The EA288evo is a highly robust iron-block engine. Lifespan is exceptional, provided the complex cooling system and the advanced Twin-Dosing AdBlue/DPF emissions systems are meticulously maintained).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (BorgWarner VNT. Features a water-cooled intercooler integrated directly into the intake manifold for rapid response and very short charge piping).", ecuType: "Bosch EDC17C74 (Highly advanced emissions control, managing the 12V Belt Alternator Starter, dual EGR systems, and the complex Twin-Dosing SCR catalytic process).", euroStandard: "Euro 6d-ISC-FCM", maxPowerStockInternals: "270+ hp (The core block is heavily over-engineered, but the factory turbocharger and DL382 clutch packs form the primary bottlenecks).",
