        timingType: "Chain (EA888 Gen 4 'evo4' architecture integrated with a high-voltage PHEV system. Features an incredibly robust timing chain system).", injectionType: "Direct Injection (FSI exclusively. Gen 4 increases fuel pressure to 350 bar to improve atomization, completely dropping the MPI dual-injection of Gen 3).", engineLifespan: "300,000+ km (The Gen 4 block is practically unburstable. Lifespan is primarily dictated by the high-voltage battery degradation and the complex thermal management system).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (Continental/IHI variant. Works in tandem with a 143hp electric motor integrated directly into the transmission housing).", ecuType: "Bosch MG1 (Extremely complex engine management system orchestrating the EV transition, 350 bar injection, and OPF emissions).", euroStandard: "Euro 6d-ISC-FCM", maxPowerStockInternals: "450+ hp (The EA888 Gen 4 block is phenomenally strong, though the hybrid clutch has absolute torque limitations).",
