            "Thermostat & Water Pump Housing Leaks: Despite being Gen 4, the plastic housing still warps and cracks under thermal cycling.",
            "HV Coolant Valve Leaks: The complex array of valves directing coolant between the engine, battery, and cabin frequently leak.",
