            timingType: "Belt (EA288evo generation architecture. Toothed timing belt driving the camshafts and the high-pressure fuel pump. Strict 210,000 km replacement interval, but tensioner pulleys should be monitored).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Bosch EDC17 with 2000+ bar injection pressure and improved Bosch CP4.1 high-pressure fuel pump. Features Twin-Dosing SCR technology).", engineLifespan: "400,000+ km (The EA288evo is a highly robust iron-block engine. Lifespan is exceptional, provided the complex cooling system and the advanced Twin-Dosing emissions systems are meticulously maintained).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (BorgWarner VNT. Features a water-cooled intercooler integrated directly into the intake manifold for rapid response).", ecuType: "Bosch MD1 (Highly advanced emissions control, managing the 12V Belt Alternator Starter, dual EGR systems, and the complex Twin-Dosing SCR catalytic process).", euroStandard: "Euro 6e", maxPowerStockInternals: "240+ hp (The core block is heavily over-engineered for the 163hp output, but the factory turbocharger and DL382 clutch packs form the primary bottlenecks).",
