            timingType: "Chain (EA897evo3 architecture with Euro 6e updates. Features a heavily reinforced rear-mounted timing chain system designed for massive torque. Highly reliable, but complex to service).", injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection (Bosch EDC17 with advanced Piezo injectors, Bosch CP4.2 pump, and highly complex Twin-Dosing SCR injection).", engineLifespan: "400,000+ km (The iron block is phenomenally strong. Lifespan is not dictated by the internal mechanics, but rather by the highly complex 48V electrical system and Twin-Dosing emissions equipment).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger + Electric Compressor (BorgWarner VNT turbo assisted by a 48V Electric Powered Compressor (EPC) that spools instantly to eliminate turbo lag).", ecuType: "Bosch MD1 (Incredibly complex dual-management system for the VNT turbo, the 48V EPC, the BAS generator, and Twin-Dosing SCR).", euroStandard: "Euro 6e", maxPowerStockInternals: "500+ hp (The EA897evo3 block is legendary for its durability, easily handling upgraded hybrid turbos).",
            fuelConsumption: { city: "8.0 - 9.0 L/100km", highway: "5.8 - 6.8 L/100km", mixed: "6.5 - 7.5 L/100km", sporty: "10.0+ L/100km" },
