            timingType: "Chain (EA839 architecture. Features a rear-mounted timing chain system. Highly robust, with updated tensioners and guides from the factory to prevent the failures seen on early C8 models).", injectionType: "Direct Injection (FSI. Highly pressurized injection system optimized for the B-cycle combustion process).", engineLifespan: "300,000+ km (The block is robust, but the engine is surrounded by highly complex C9 electronics, OPF, and the 48V Belt Alternator Starter system).", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (Twin-Scroll turbocharger mounted inside the 'Hot V' of the engine block. Provides immediate response and minimizes exhaust routing).", ecuType: "Bosch MG1 (Extremely complex engine management integrating the 48V MHEV system, predictive efficiency assist, OPF, and active thermal management).", euroStandard: "Euro 6e", maxPowerStockInternals: "600+ hp (The EA839 block and rotating assembly are incredibly strong and receptive to large hybrid turbo upgrades).",
