                "Transmission Clutch Failure - The DL382+ transmission is operating near its upper torque limit. Tuning without a TCU reflash will quickly burn up the clutch packs.",
                "Rear Main Seal Blowout - A ruptured PCV valve pressurizes the engine crankcase, blowing out the rear main seal and requiring a transmission-out repair.",
                "Turbo Heat Soak - The Hot-V layout generates immense heat. Prolonged aggressive driving without an upgraded intercooler will cause the ECU to pull timing."
